LayoutGrid 32x9

Components:
  [0] input_pin "a" @(0,0) 5x3
  [1] input_pin "b" @(0,6) 5x3
  [22] output_pin "out" @(25,0) 7x3
  [23] subcircuit:xnor "g" @(10,0) 10x5

Wires:
  0.out -> 23.a: (5,1) -> (6,1) -> (9,1)
  1.out -> 23.b: (5,7) -> (6,7) -> (6,3) -> (9,3)
  23.out -> 22.in: (20,2) -> (21,2) -> (21,1) -> (24,1)
